...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

team: HackerNews Team { class: ours }
openai: OpenAI API { class: ext }
web: Web Searcher { class: ours }
ddg: DuckDuckGo 검색 { class: ext }

team -> openai: user(질문) + 앞선 위임 호출 · 보고서(tool 메시지)
openai -> team: delegate_task_to_member(\nweb-searcher, task)
team -> web: task 문자열
web -> openai: 역할 · 시각 · task\n+ 도구 스키마
openai -> web: web_search(query,\nmax_results)
web -> ddg: 검색어 (ddgs)
ddg -> web: 검색 결과 JSON
